    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d607">

                <pb facs="0820" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1934v02/pg720"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5831/132</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-10-11">October 11, 1934</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Swedish Minister called and delivered to me a memorandum, of which the
                    attached is a copy,<anchor n="17" xml:id="d607-f1"/> relating to proposed trade
                    agreement negotiations between our two governments. I thanked him and replied
                        <pb facs="0821" n="721" xml:id="pg721"/> that I and my associates would give
                    the subject matter of his memorandum the fullest and most careful attention and
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ull</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
